      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>July 22, 2025</color>\nJahoda\n\"The moon's a long way off. We might go hungry, but at least we have plenty of time.\"\n<color=#ffacff>HoYoLAB:</color> <color=#37ffff>https:/www.hoyolab.com/article/40132513</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
