      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/12/15/35428890/177fd0394d71f23b1974bdb5892cb061_2660927693049280144.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>December 10, 2025</color>\n\"Winter nights know no mercy. She left her curtained nest in frost and snow; no one is obliged to restore that which she has lost.\"\n— Anastasya Feodorovna Snezhnaya\n<color=#ffacff>HoYoLAB:</color> <color=#37ffff>https:/www.hoyolab.com/article/42712465</color>"
      },
      {
