        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>September 28, 2025</color>\nIf a picture can help people traverse through time,\nthen the bearer of this picture can also journey through dimensions of chronology and space. They can tread through meadows of blooming flowers, toward the wind that brought that bouquet,\nto step back into the liveliest moment of the banquet.\n<color=#ffacff>HoYoLAB:</color> <color=#37ffff>https:/www.hoyolab.com/article/41392606</color>"
